    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success In Progress is a precision platformer game focused on improving, in which failure helps you get closer to the goal each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fail, you splash, creating tomato sauce that will help you go higher every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 full-length levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One very handsome Tomato</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special modifiers to re-play the levels in a completely different way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Drawn graphics, for every single bit of a level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every salad?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success In Progress is a precision platformer game focused on improving, in which failure helps you get closer to the goal each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fail, you splash, creating tomato sauce that will help you go higher every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 full-length levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One very handsome Tomato</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special modifiers to re-play the levels in a completely different way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Drawn graphics, for every single bit of a level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every salad?</p>",
    "short_description": "Become a brave tomato soldier on a quest to invade salads! In this challenging precision platformer, falling isn\u2019t the end\u2014it\u2019s part of the journey. Each splash you make clears your path to victory. Remember: failure is just Success In Progress!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America",
